@startuml 
title ** DetailStatement **

actor User
participant 前台 
actor Admin
participant 後台 
participant Settle.Worker 
participant Wager.Worker 


database  TpBetRecord   
database  TpDetailTodo
database  TpBetRecordDetail
participant Detail.Worker 
Group GetDetail by Wager.Worker
Wager.Worker -> Wager.Worker : 定期執行
Wager.Worker -> TpBetRecordDetail : Insert / Update \n Bet Detail
END


Group GetDetail by Detail.Worker
Settle.Worker-> Settle.Worker: 定期執行
Settle.Worker -> TpBetRecord : Insert / Update \n Settle BetRecord 
TpBetRecord -> TpDetailTodo :  Insert \n TpId、TransId
Detail.Worker-> Detail.Worker: 定期執行
Detail.Worker -> TpDetailTodo : Select \n TpId、TransId
TpDetailTodo -> Detail.Worker : Get TpId、TransId
Detail.Worker -> TPHanlder :TpId、TransId
TPHanlder -> TPHanlder:TpId Invoke TPMethod
TPHanlder -> TPMethod:TransId
TPMethod -> ThirdPartyAPI :TransId
ThirdPartyAPI -> ThirdPartyAPI :Get Bet Detail
ThirdPartyAPI -> TPMethod : Bet Detail
TPMethod -> TPHanlder : Bet Detail
TPHanlder -> Detail.Worker : Bet Detail
Detail.Worker ->  TpBetRecordDetail : Insert / Update \n Bet Detail
alt Success
    Detail.Worker ->  TpDetailTodo : Delete TpId、TransId
else Fail
    Detail.Worker ->  TpDetailTodo : 等待下一次執行
end


END

Group 前台查詢
User -> 前台:查詢 Bet Detail
前台 -> TpBetRecord:TransId
TpBetRecord -> TpBetRecordDetail:TransId
TpBetRecordDetail -> TpBetRecord : Bet Detail
TpBetRecord -> 前台 : Bet Detail
END

GROUP 後台查詢
Admin -> 後台:查詢 Bet Detail
後台 -> TpBetRecord:TransId
TpBetRecord -> TpBetRecordDetail:TransId
TpBetRecordDetail -> TpBetRecord : Bet Detail
TpBetRecord -> 後台 : Bet Detail
END
@enduml